# Intelligence Sprint Doctrine (Farfalle ↔ CRM)

## Goal
Deliver end‑to‑end company/lead intelligence: given a company/domain, Farfalle gathers web insights (Tavily + optional LinkedIn/Diffbot), synthesizes a concise summary and actionable items, and (optionally) persists to CRM (Note + JSON attachment).

