## Architecture & Data Flow
1) SPA /crm/ai submits `{ company, domain? }` to Farfalle endpoint `/intel/enrich_lead`.
2) Farfalle calls IntelligenceService.analyze(company, questions, domain) → providers (Tavily; optionally LinkedIn, Diffbot).
3) Farfalle normalizes the result and runs a built-in summarizer → 3–6 bullets + recommended next steps.
4) SPA renders summary, extracted_people, and sources; user can "Save to CRM" (Note + JSON attachment).

## Endpoints & Contracts
- `POST /intel/enrich_lead`
  - Request:
    ```json
    { "company": "Abbey Capital", "domain": "abbeycapital.com" }
    ```
  - Response (normalized):
    ```json
    {
      "company": "Abbey Capital",
      "summary": ["...", "..."],
      "key_insights": ["..."],
      "results": [
        {
          "question": "Who are the decision-makers?",
          "answer": "...",
          "sources": [{"title":"...","url":"..."}],
          "extracted_people": [{"name":"...","title":"...","linkedin_url":"..."}]
        }
      ],
      "total_sources": 7
    }
    ```

