    -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
    -d '{"company":"Abbey Capital","domain":"abbeycapital.com"}' | jq .
  ```
- SPA:
  - Open `/crm/ai`; analyze 3 known companies; verify summary exists and shows at least 3 bullets and 3 sources.
- (Optional) Save to CRM:
  - Click "Save to CRM"; verify a `FCRM Note` with title "Intel: {company}" and content with bullets; JSON attachment stored.

## Telemetry
